Well, how experienced are you?  And experience in one area of advanced 
mathematics need not carry over to others. though, by its nature, someone in 
category theory probably knows a bit about some other areas.  The reverse is 
markedly not true as a rule.
If the present problem is merely terminological, as it seems to be, then 
extensive knowledge is not needed -- we can either follow mathematical usage or 
insist on distinctions of some sort that usage does not., leaving context to 
decide.




